# Normalise text to LF in the repository and working tree on every OS. Generated
# schemas, snapshots and catalog content are compared byte-for-byte in CI, so
# CRLF conversion on Windows checkouts would break those checks.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
# The packed catalog embedded in the binary (cargo xtask pack-catalog). Never convert or diff it.
*.pack binary
